SUMMARY:Costumes\, Candy\, and Community: LCDP’s Halloween Party Is Back
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a spooky good time\, because La Casa de Don Pedro’s Family Success Center I is throwing a Halloween Party\, and everyone is invited. \nOn Thursday\, October 30\, 2025\, families are welcome to join us from 5:00 PM to 6:30 PM at 23 Broadway\, Newark\, NJ for an evening packed with costumes\, music\, snacks\, and plenty of fun for kids of all ages. \nThis one is all about joy. No workshops\, no paperwork\, no agenda. Just good old-fashioned Halloween celebration for the families and children we serve every day. \nHere is what to expect: \n\nWear your favorite costume and show it off\nMusic\, food\, fun\, and laughs\nA warm\, welcoming space where every family belongs\nMemories worth keeping\n\nAt LCDP\, we believe community is built not just through services but through shared moments of celebration. Our families work hard. Our kids deserve to just be kids sometimes. Halloween night at the Family Success Center is exactly that kind of moment. \nCome in costume. Come ready to laugh. And if you dare\, enter if you can. \nRegistration is required. Scan the QR code on the flyer or visit tinyurl.com/LaCasaFSCReg to register.
URL:https://lacasadedonpedro.org/event/costumes-candy-and-community-lcdps-halloween-party-is-back/
LOCATION:23 Broadway\, 23 Broadway\, Newark\, NJ\, 07104\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lacasadedonpedro.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Halloween-Party-2025-English.png
END:VEVENT
